<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">- Matumbi Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">1 PETILI</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Pet</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Petili</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua Nongoi ya Petili</para>
  <para style="mt1">1 Petili</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua Nongoi ya Petili</para>
  <para style="imt">Kilongolyo</para>
  <para style="ip">Balua ya 1 Petili yaandikilwe na Ntumilwe Petili. Petili atumbwi andika balua yake kwa kwiawanikia ywembe nga nyai na balu' baandikyage. Balua yake yaali'ngite Akilisitu boti babatama, Kati ageni mudunia. (1:1). Kwa mala yambone ywembe aatambwa asomi bake kwa lina li'. Kwa mwanjaa balua yake kwa upande wi'ngi' ilandana na balua kwa Aefeso. Bandu baingi bau'bi'lya panga, balua ya 1 Petili yaandikilwe bu'ka pa balua kwa Aefeso munsimu wauegelya mwaka 65 bu'ka po belekwa kwa Yesu Kilisitu. Pauli aandike balua yi' abile mumuyi wa Roma pandu paapakemike mwene Babeli (5:13).</para>
  <para style="ip">Petili ayaulya panga aandike balua kwa kitumbu sa, “Kunsenga na kunkong'ondelya panga, ayi' nga ngu'ngu' ya kweli ya Nnu'ngu'. Muyi'me kwo kangamala kwa yo.” (5:12) Kubile na ali yo landana kati ya 1 Petili 2:11-3:7, Aefeso 5:18-6:9, na Akolosai 3:18-4:6. Amwo mutatu mwoti muawanikia bu'kana na umope wa familia no yu'wa kwa mamlaka ga utawala. Kai' Petili aasenga Akilisitu panga bakomeye paipitya ngu'su'mbu'.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mutasali</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Petili aitapa mwene na aatambwa asomi baali'ngite mubalua yake <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1PE 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Ansukulu Nnu'ngu' kwa kitumbu sa ukosopoli wabapanga nabo boti kiselele na aawanikia kilombolyo sa ukweli wo mumaisa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1PE 1:3-2:10">1:3-2:10</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Abakia aumini bu'kana no tama maisa manogau mudunia na abaya ngongo bu'kana na umope wa nsengo na nnyumbo na mmanda na nngwana wake <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1PE 2:11-4:11">2:11-4:11</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Petili aayi'ya mwoyo bakomeye pabapata ngu'su'mbu' <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1PE 4:12-5:11">4:12-5:11</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Ayomolya balua yake <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1PE 5:12-14">5:12-14</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1" />Nenga na Petili nantumilwe wa Yesu Kilisitu, nimwandikyanga mwenga mwamusaulilwe na Tati' Nnu'ngu', mwenga mwamutalukine no tama kati mwaalungulungu akwo Ponto, Galatia, Kapadokia, Asia na Bisinia. <verse eid="1PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2" />Tati' Nnu'ngu' bansawi mwenga bu'ka kwai'mbu' kwo binia kwabe, na mupangilwe mwaapeleteu na Loo mupate kunnyu'wa Yesu Kilisitu no peleteyelwa kwa myai yake.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:2">Ninnu'byanga ngu'ngu' na amani yambone.<verse eid="1PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Liu'bi'lyo likangamala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3" />Alumbilwe Nnu'ngu' na Tati' ba Bwana witu Yesu Kilisitu! Kwa kiya sake kiku'lu' aatupangite tubelekwe mala yenebi'li' kwa kunnyu'ya Yesu bu'ka kwa awi'li na kutuyalya liu'bi'lyo lyene ukoto. <verse eid="1PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4" />Nambi'yambi', tupi'kanilya lisi balaka yaibi'kilwe na Nnu'ngu' kunani kwa bandu bake. Balaka yo iwesali bola, alabika wala umala. <verse eid="1PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5" />Nnu'ngu' atumya makakala gake maku'lu' li'nga kunni'ndi'la mwenga kwa mwanjaa mumwu'bi'lya Yesu Kilisitu. Aalu'a yendelya kunni'ndi'la mpaka ukosopoli pawalu'a umukulwa masu'ba ga kuundi'la. <verse eid="1PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6" />Ali' limpanga mupulaike muno, ata ikapangite kwa masu'ba masene mwendausunika kwa kitumbu so auyilwa na ngu'su'mbu' mbali'mbali'. <verse eid="1PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7" />Mapayilwo go gaipaya imani yinu ibonekane panga ya kakape. Pamope no panga zaabu kikowe sakialabika, lakini ipeleteyelwa kwo yoselwa pamwoto. Nyinyonyo na imani yitu yaibile na samani kulikoni zaabu, ipalikwa ipayilwe li'nga panga ya kakape. Na kwa kitumbu so, mwalu'a pata sipwa, utukupu na isima palu' paapitya Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="1PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8" />Ywembe mwendakumpenda pamope no panga munammonali, ata nambi'yambi' mummonali lakini mwendakumwu'bi'lya no pulaika muno kwa pulaa yangali longeleka na yene utukupu, <verse eid="1PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9" />kwa mwanjaa, muupokya ukosopoli wa loo yinu, na amo nga mwaili'nga imani yinu.<verse eid="1PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10" />Alondoli ba Nnu'ngu' baatipekeseni no lokikiya bu'kana na ukosopoli wo, ngabalondwa panga, ngu'ngu' ilu'a kumwikya mwenga. <verse eid="1PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11" />Loo wa Kilisitu aabile nkati yabe aalondwi panga Kilisitu aalu'a ku'su'mbu'lwa, na payaapi'ta ngu'su'mbu' yo aalu'a pata utukupu. Alondoli bo ba Nnu'ngu' baapalike muno batange panga makowe go gaapangika pakubawi na gampata kitiwi. <verse eid="1PE 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12" />Nnu'ngu' aaumukuli alondoli bo panga, makowe gabalondwage gaabileli ga pwaila yabe bene, ila gaabile ginu mwenga. Nabembe bamwali Abali yo Inannoga kwa uweso wa Loo Mpeleteu ywaatumilwe bu'ka kunani. Makowe go ata malaika bendaminyikiya muno kugatanga.<verse eid="1PE 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkemo wo tama maisa mapeleteu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13" />Kwa nyo, mutame wiso kwa kugatumya malango ginu. Mutame minyo na mubi'ke liu'bi'lyo linu lyoti mungu'ngu' yi'lu' yamwaapeyelwa paabonekana Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="1PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14" />Mwenga mwabana ba Nnu'ngu' ywamunnyu'wa, katu kanemuyi'ki'ti kugabi'ngi'ya maminyikio maakau gamwaabile nago pamwaabile mwaalalo. <verse eid="1PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15" />Ila, mupalikwa baa mwaapeleteu muiyendo yinu yoti kati mu'lu' mwabile mpeleteu yu'lu' ywaankemite. <verse eid="1PE 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16" />Kwa mwanjaa Nnu'ngu' aalongei mu Maandiko Mapeleteu panga, <char style="qt">“Mubee mwaapeleteu, kwa mwanjaa nenga nampeleteu.”</char><verse eid="1PE 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17" />Pamuntambwa Nnu'ngu' mwenga munkema Tati'. Bai, mutange panga ywembe amuukumu kila mundu bu'kana na iyendo yake pangali bawa. Kwa nyo, mutumi wakati winu wauigalile pano padunia kwa kunkilikitya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="1PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18" />Kwa mwanjaa mwenga mutangite panga, mwaakosopolilwe bu'ka munnyendo winu wangalipwaika wamwaupoki bu'ka kwa api'ndo binu. Lakini mutange panga Nnu'ngu' ankosopoli lili kwa ili'be yaialabika, kwa mbanje wala zaabu, <verse eid="1PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19" />ila kwa myai ya samani ya Kilisitu, ywaabile kati mwana ngondolo ywangali sambi wala lilembele. <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus the Lamb of God - GT00135" file="JesusTheLambOfGod_1Pet1.19_GT00135.jpg" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Gordon Thompson © Wycliffe Bible Translators Inc., 2012." ref="1:19" /> <verse eid="1PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20" />Ywembe aabaulilwe na Nnu'ngu' dunia ibile balo umbilwa, ngaumukulwa mumasu'ba gano ga kuundi'la kwa kitumbu sinu. <verse eid="1PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21" />Kwo pi'tya ywembe, mumwu'bi'lya Nnu'ngu' ywannyu'yite bu'ka kwa awi'li na kumpeya utukupu, li'nga imani na mau'bi'lyo ginu gabe kwa Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="1PE 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22" />Mwiipeletiye loo yinu kwa kwiyu'wa yi'lu' kweli, na nambi'yambi' muwesa kwapenda ainu pangali unapiki. Bai, mupendane kwa mwoyo woti. <verse eid="1PE 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23" />Kwa mwanjaa mubelekwi mala yenebi'li', belekwa kwo ku'bu'kineli na akinatati' binu mwabene babawesa waa, ila mubelekwi kwa liyi'gi'yo lya Nnu'ngu' lyalibile likoti no konda mpaka milele. <verse eid="1PE 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24" />Kati mwagabaya Maandiko Mapeleteu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">
    <char style="qt">“Bandu boti babile kati maakapi, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">
    <char style="qt">na utukupu wabe woti ubile kati lilu'ba lya maakapi.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">
    <char style="qt">Maakapi gendapu'pwa na malu'ba gendapolota. </char><verse eid="1PE 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25" />
    <char style="qt">Lakini liyi'gi'yo lya Nnu'ngu' likonda milele.” </char></para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 1:25">Liyi'gi'yo lyo nga ayo Abali Inannoga yamualilwe.<verse eid="1PE 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2" />
  <para style="s1">Liwe likoti na taipwa lipeleteu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1" />Bai, muuleke ulau woti, na sampuli yoti ya ubu'su', unapiki na bwigu, wala kanemubalane ata pasene. <verse eid="1PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2" />Kati mu'lu' bana ilekeleke mwabaminyikiya mabele, namwenga nyinyonyo mupalikwa baa na nnyota ya mabele ga kiloo, li'nga kwa makakala gake mupate ku'la no kosopolelwa. <verse eid="1PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3" />Kati mwagabaya Maandiko Mapeleteu, <char style="qt">“Mukwipwi panga Bwana nga nnogau.”</char><verse eid="1PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4" />Bai, munnyendeli Bwana! Ywembe nga liwe lyu'mi lyalikanilwe na bandu, lakini kwa Nnu'ngu' nga liwe lyalisawile na lya samani ngu'lu'. <verse eid="1PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5" />Munnyendeli ywembe kati maliwe mau'mi, mukasengeke no pangika nyumba ya kiloo, amo mwalu'a tumikia kati mwaapi'ndo aku'lu' ba dini mwamupeletike kwo piya salaka ya kiloo yaiyi'ki'ti'lwa kwake kwa ndi'la ya Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="1PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6" />Kwa mwanjaa, bu'kana na ywembe yandikilwe mu Maandiko panga, <char style="qt">“Lola, nibi'ka liwe mu Sayuni liwe lya nsingi, lisaulilwa na lyene samani. Mundu ywamwu'bi'lya ywo aaibonali oni.” </char><verse eid="1PE 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7" />Kwinu mwenga mwamuu'bi'lya liwe lyo, nga lya samani ngu'lu', lakini kwa balu' bangali u'bi'lya, <char style="qt">“Liwe lyabalikani asengi, nambi'yambi' lipangike liwe liku'lu' lya pakitumembe.”</char> <verse eid="1PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8" />Kai', Maandiko gabaya, <char style="qt">“Liwe lyo nga li'lu' lyabaliku'bala bandu, mpi'mbi' wa kwatu'mbu'ya bandu.”</char> Bandu baku'bala kwa mwanjaa baliu'bi'li lili li'lu' liyi'gi'yo lya Nnu'ngu', na ago nga gababi'kilwe bu'ka tokyaa.<verse eid="1PE 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9" />Lakini mwenga mwabandu mwamusaulilwe na Nnu'ngu' na upi'ndo nku'lu' wa dini ya kikulungwa. Mwenga mwa taipwa lyalipeletike na mwabandu baa kisake mwamubaulilwe na Nnu'ngu'. Musaulilwe li'nga mwiale iyendo ngu'lu' ya yu'lu' ywankemite bu'ka kulubi'ndu' na kunnyingiya ku bweya wake wa ayabu. <verse eid="1PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10" />Masu'ba ga nsu'gu', mwaabileli mwabandu ba Nnu'ngu', lakini nambi'yambi' mwenga mwabandu bake. Kai', mwaabi'kilweli kiya na Nnu'ngu', lakini nambi'yambi' mubi'kilwe kiya.<verse eid="1PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Atumisi ba Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11" />Mwaapendwa bangu', ninking'indya mwenga kwa mwanjaa, pano padunia mwaageni na mwaapi'tandi'la, bai mugayepe maminyikiyo ga yi'ga gagayu'mana na loo yinu. <verse eid="1PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12" />Nnyendo winu pakati ya bandu bangalikuntanga Nnu'ngu', upalikwa ube unannoga muno li'nga ata mana banku'pi'ki'ya panga mupanga maakau, bawese tanga iyendo yinu ngolou na nnyo bankwi'ye Nnu'ngu' lisu'ba lyo isa kwake.<verse eid="1PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13" />Bai, mwibi'ke pai' ya utawala woti wa kimundu kwa kitumbu sa Bwana. Mumwisimu nkulungwa winu, kwa mwanjaa ywembe nga kolongosi nku'lu' munni'ma winu. <verse eid="1PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14" />Mwayu'we alongosi babatumilwe na nkulungwa. Batumilwe li'nga kwapwatya babapanga makosa, na kwalumba babanogeya. <verse eid="1PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15" />Kwa mwanjaa Nnu'ngu' apala kwo panga kwitu manogau, twiimiye milongelo ya kilalo ya bandu bangali malango. <verse eid="1PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16" />Mutame kati bandu bababile ulu, lakini kanemutumi uulu wo li'nga kugawi'ki'lya malau lili, ila mutame kati mwaatumisi ba Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="1PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17" />Mwaisimu bandu boti, mwapende alongo binu aumini, munnyogope Nnu'ngu', na kumwisimu nkulungwa.<verse eid="1PE 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mpwano wa ngu'su'mbu' ya Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18" />Mwenga mwaabanda, mwatumikiye angwana binu kwa isima yoti, kwenda kwa balu' babaliyaa na bene ikima baili, ila ata kwa bababile alau. <verse eid="1PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19" />Mwanjaa, mana mundu akomeya ngu'su'mbu' yangali yake kwa kumwisimu Nnu'ngu', bai, Nnu'ngu' alu'a kunnyalya. <verse eid="1PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20" />Kwa mwanjaa mupata ki'li' pamuku'mbu'lwa kwa kitumbu so panga sambi? Lakini mana kauteselwa kwo panga manogau no komeya, ali' Nnu'ngu' alipendile. <verse eid="1PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21" />Ago nga gamukemilwe, mwanjaa Kilisitu mwene aatesilwe kwa kitumbu sinu, ngaanekya go li'nga mubi'ngi'ye njayo yake. <verse eid="1PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22" />Kati mwagabaya maandiko Mapeleteu panga, <char style="qt">“Ywembe aapangiteli sambi wala likowe lya ubu'su' lyayu'wanikeli munkano wake.”</char> <verse eid="1PE 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23" />Paatukanilwe ywembe ayangwili kwa matukano, patesilwe ywembe ayogwiyeli, ila aagabi'i mau'bi'lyo gake kwa Nnu'ngu', akimu mwene aki. <verse eid="1PE 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24" />Ywembe mwene <char style="qt">aagapu'twi masambi gitu</char> muyi'ga yake kunani ya nsalaba, li'nga twenga kanetutawalilwe na sambi kai', ila tutame maisa ga kumpulaisa Nnu'ngu'. <char style="qt">Kwo ku'mbu'lwa kwake, tupatike ukoto.</char> <verse eid="1PE 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25" />Mwenga <char style="qt">mwaabile kati ngondolo babaobite, </char> lakini nambi'yambi' muki'li'bwike kwa nsungi na nni'ndi'li ywa loo yinu.<verse eid="1PE 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3" />
  <para style="s1">Nsengo na nnyumbo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1" />Nyinyonyo na mwenga mwa akinaayumbo, mwagegekeye akinasengo binu li'nga mana mubile na annalu'me bangali u'bi'lya liyi'gi'yo lya Nnu'ngu', bau'bi'li kwa kuubona nnyendo winu. Yaapalikwali longela kikowe, <verse eid="1PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2" />kwa mwanjaa baaubona nnyendo winu mwaunogelile na wa kunnyogopa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="1PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3" />Kanemwu'bi'li kwiinemeka kwo tiba ndibe, wala ili'be ya zaabu no wala ngu'bo ya bei ngu'lu'. <verse eid="1PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4" />Ila, ugolou winu upalikwa utumbuli pamwoyo, ugolou wangali alabika lombolya loo yo tu'ya no gegeya. Awo nga ugolou wa samani ngu'lu' kwa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="1PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5" />Nyo, ngamwabaainemike alwawa ba kwai'mbu' bene ikima babantumikiye Nnu'ngu', baatami pai' ya amuli ya akinasengo babe. <verse eid="1PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6" />Sara, nga yumo ywa alwawa babapalikwa yigilwa, kwa mwanjaa ywembe aannyu'wine nsengowe Bulaimu ata kunkema bwana wake. Na mwenga mwaalwawa, mwa bana ba kweli ba Sara mana mubile kamupanga galu' gagapalikwa pangali yogopa.<verse eid="1PE 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7" />Nyinyonyo na mwenga mwa analu'me, mutame na ayumbo binu kwa malango kamutanga panga bembe ntu'pu' makakala kati mwenga. Mwalinguli wiso kwa isima, kwa mwanjaa na bembe baalu'a lisi ngu'ngu' ya ukoto pamope na mwenga. Kwa nyo, mwanalu'me mupange nyo li'nga gamulu'ba kwa Nnu'ngu', gapokelelwe.<verse eid="1PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ku'su'mbu'lwa kwa kitumbu so panga manogau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8" />Likowe lya kuundi'la nga ali', mube na libinio limo, kamubi'kyana kiya, kamupendana kati mwaalongo, mube mwaliya ku'no kamugegekeyana. <verse eid="1PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9" />Kanemwabukiye bandu kwa malau gabampangya, kati ulau kwa ulau au litukano kwa litukano, ila mwalu'bi bayaliwe, kwa mwanjaa mwenga mwaakemilwe na Nnu'ngu' li'nga mulisi balaka. <verse eid="1PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10" />Kati mwagabaya Maandiko Mapeleteu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:10">
    <char style="qt">“Ywapala pulaikya maisa, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:10">
    <char style="qt">na kulibona lisu'ba lyo yaliwa, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:10">
    <char style="qt">lulimi lwake kanelulongele malau, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:10">
    <char style="qt">ayepe longela ubu'su'. </char><verse eid="1PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11" />
    <char style="qt">Aibawe na ulau, apange manogau,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:11">
    <char style="qt">apale amani na kwibi'ka pamwoyo. </char><verse eid="1PE 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12" />
    <char style="qt">Mwanjaa, Bwana aalingulya bene aki na kugapi'kania gabalu'ba. </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:12">
    <char style="qt">Lakini aalaya su'gu' bandu babapanga malau.” </char><verse eid="1PE 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13" />Manaitei kamubinia panga manogau, nyai ywaapala kunsulu? <verse eid="1PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14" />Lakini, ata ikatei mwaateseka kwa kitumbu so panga manogau, Nnu'ngu' aalu'a kunnyalya. <char style="qt">Kanemunnyogope mundu ywoywoti wala kanemuyi'ki'ti yogoya kwabe.</char> <verse eid="1PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15" />Lakini mumpei utukupu Kilisitu, ywembe nga Bwana mumyoyo yinu. Mutame wiso kunnyangwa kila mundu ywannaluya bu'kana na mau'bi'lyo gagabile nkati yinu. <verse eid="1PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16" />Lakini mupange nnyo kwo gegeya na isima. Mubini ganannoga li'nga pamutukanilwa, balu' babalongela malau bu'kana na nnyendo winu unannoga mu Kilisitu, baibone oni. <verse eid="1PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17" />Mwanjaa nantali teselwa kwa kitumbu so panga manogau manaitei nga mwapendi Nnu'ngu', kulikoni teselwa kwa kitumbu so panga malau. <verse eid="1PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18" />Kwa mwanjaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:18">Kilisitu aatesilwe mala yimo kwa kitumbu sa masambi gitu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:18">
    <char style="qt">mwene aki kwa kitumbu sabe bangali aki, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:18">li'nga atulete kwa Nnu'ngu'.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:18">Aabulagilwe yi'ga lakini aayu'yilwe kiloo.<verse eid="1PE 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19" />Kwa nyo, aayi'i kwialya loo akwo kwaitabilwe.<verse eid="1PE 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20" />Abo, nga balu' babaakani kunnyu'wa Nnu'ngu' paali'ndike kwo komeya nsimu wa Nuu paabile kaitengenesa safina. Nkati ya sombo so, baayingi bandu banane bai babaakosopolilwe kwo pi'tya masi'. <figure style="fig" alt="Noah's ark during flood - CN02094" file="Noah'sArkDuringFlood_Heb11.7_CN02094.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="3:20" /> <verse eid="1PE 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21" />Masi' ga nga mpwano wa ubatiso waunkosopolya masu'ba gano kwo yu'ka kwake Yesu Kilisitu, kwenda bi'ka kuutalu usapu wa yi'gali, ila lilagano lya mabinio ganannoga kwa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="1PE 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22" />Ywembe aayi'i kunani na nambi'yambi' atami kummalyo ga Nnu'ngu'. Atawala malaika na yumbe yoti yene utawala na yene makakala.<verse eid="1PE 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4" />
  <para style="s1">Maisa gayambi'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1" />Bai, kwa mwanjaa Kilisitu aatesilwe muyi'ga yake, na mwenga mutame wiso na mabinio gaagalu'galu', kwa mwanjaa ywembe ywatesilwe muyi'ga alaya panga, alekangine na sambi. <verse eid="1PE 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2" />Tumbulya nambi'yambi', maisa gagaigile go tama pano padunia, gapalikwa galongoyelwe kati mwapala Nnu'ngu', kwenda kwa maminyikio ga kimundu lili. <verse eid="1PE 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3" />Mwanjaa, masu'ba ginu gagapite gali'ngani kwo panga makowe gabapanga bandu bangali kuntanga Nnu'ngu'. Mwaatami kwo panga upege, kwipenda mwabene, lobya, kalamu yo milamuno, nywa muno na ata kwikilikitya inyago. <verse eid="1PE 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4" />Nambi'yambi', bandu bangali kuntanga Nnu'ngu' bendasangala kwa kitumbu so kotoka panga nabo kiselele palu' pabapanga malau go pi'ti'li'ki'ya, kwa nyo bendakuntukana. <verse eid="1PE 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5" />Lakini baapalikwa kwiyi'mya nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu', ywembe atami wiso kwaukumu bandu boti, bau'mi na babawile. <verse eid="1PE 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6" />Mwanjaa, kwa kitumbu so ata abo babawile baalilwe Abali Inannoga, pamope no panga baaukumilwe muyi'ga kati mwabaukumilwa bandu bi'ngi', baatama muloo kati Nnu'ngu' ywatama muloo.<verse eid="1PE 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ywakota wiso upo ya Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7" />Kuundi'la wa ili'be yoti wegelile. Kwa nyo mupalikwa tama kwo li'ngi'lya no keleka li'nga muwese saalya. <verse eid="1PE 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8" />Likowe lya ngama muno nga ali', mupendane kwa mwoyo woti, kwa mwanjaa <char style="qt">upendo uwi'ki'lya uyolou wa sambi.</char> <verse eid="1PE 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9" />Mukemyane mwabene na bene pangali ku'ku'li'ka. <verse eid="1PE 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10" />Kila mundu apalikwa tumya ngu'ngu' yayaliwite bu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu' kwa pwaila ya bi'ngi' kati ywakota wiso upo mbali'mbali' ya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="1PE 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11" />Ywalongela kili'be, gaagalongela gabe kati galongelelwa na Nnu'ngu', ywatumika apalikwa tumika kwa makakala gayaliwa na Nnu'ngu', li'nga mumakowe goti, Nnu'ngu' akwi'yi'lwe kwa ndi'la ya Yesu Kilisitu mwene utukupu na makakala goti gake milele na milele, amina.<verse eid="1PE 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ku'su'mbu'lwa Kikilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12" />Mwamambwiga bangu', kanemusangale kwa mateso gamugapata nambi'yambi', kwa mwanjaa mateso go gaipaya imani yinu. Kanemuwase ali' lyalipitya kwinu panga likowe lya ayabu. <verse eid="1PE 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13" />Ila, mupulaike panga mupanga kiselele mumateso ga Kilisitu li'nga muwese baa na pulaa ngu'lu' palu' pawaumukulwa utukupu wake. <verse eid="1PE 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14" />Nantali yinu manaitei kamutukanilwa kwa kitumbu sa lina lya Kilisitu, mwanjaa <char style="qt">Loo ntukupu wa Nnu'ngu' atama na mwenga.</char> <verse eid="1PE 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15" />Kaneabe mundu ywoywoti pakati yinu ywapalikwa teselwa kwa kitumbu ywembe mmulagi, mwii, nnau au ywaiyingiya mumaisa ga mundu ywi'ngi'. <verse eid="1PE 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16" />Lakini mana mundu kateseka kwa mwanjaa ywembe Nkilisitu, bai kaneaibone oni, ila ankwi'ye Nnu'ngu' kwa mwanjaa mundu ywo akemelwa kwa lina lyo.<verse eid="1PE 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17" />Nsimu wa ukumu wikite, na ukumu yo itumbulya kwa bandu bake mwene Nnu'ngu'. Manaitei ukumu yo itumbulya kwitu twenga, bai kuuyomolyo wake kwaalu'a panga buli kwa balu' bangali u'bi'lya Abali Inannoga ya Nnu'ngu'? <verse eid="1PE 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18" />Kati mwagabaya Maandiko Mapeleteu, <char style="qt">“Inonwipe kwa bandu bene aki kosopolelwa, yaapanga buli, kwa bangali kunkilikitya Nnu'ngu' na bene sambi?”</char> <verse eid="1PE 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19" />Kwa nyo, balu' babateseka bu'kana na mwapala Nnu'ngu', baibi'ke loo yabe mumaboko ga Muumba wabe ywau'bi'li'ka, ku'no kabayendelya panga ganannoga.<verse eid="1PE 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5" />
  <para style="s">Kipi'nga sa Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1" />Nenga na mpi'ndo pakati yinu mwaapi'ndo ayangu', ninkong'ondelya kwo lola kwa minyo gangu' mateso ga Kilisitu no panga kiselele wu'lu' utukupu wawaalu'a umukulwa, nendakunnu'ba muno, <verse eid="1PE 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2" />mulisunge lipi'nga lya Nnu'ngu' lyalibile kasinu na kuliyi'mi'li'ka, kwenda kwo li'ndi'ndi'lwali, ila kwo penda wamwene kati mwapala Nnu'ngu', kwenda kwo pala mbanje ya oni li, ila kwa mwoyo. <verse eid="1PE 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3" />Kanemwatawale kwa makakala abo bababi'kilwe pai' ya uli'nda winu, ila mube mwabandu bo yigilwa kwa alyo lipi'nga. <verse eid="1PE 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4" />Na wakati wo pitya Nsungi Nku'lu', mwenga mwapokya taji ya utukupu yangali alabika.<verse eid="1PE 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5" />Nyinyonyo, namwenga mwaang'elo muimani mupalikwa kwibi'ka pai' ya utawala wa api'ndo binu. Mwenga mwaboti mupalikwa mugegekeyane, kwa mwanjaa Maandiko Mapeleteu gabaya, <char style="qt">“Nnu'ngu' aataukya babaipuna, lakini apeya ngu'ngu' babagegekeya.”</char> <verse eid="1PE 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6" />Bai, mugegekeye pai' ya luboko lwa Nnu'ngu' lwene makakala li'nga amwu'bu'ye pansimu waupwaika. <verse eid="1PE 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7" />Mumpei Nnu'ngu' maauko ginu goti, kwa mwanjaa ywembe endakwisuluya muno kwa makowe ginu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 5:7">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Lion threatening flock - CO01485" file="LionThreateningFlock_CO01485.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="5:7" /> <verse eid="1PE 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8" />Mube minyo, mukeleke! Kwa mwanjaa nndumu winu Ibilisi endati'li'tati'li'ta kati imba ywabunguluma kampala mundu wa kuntangya na kummila. <verse eid="1PE 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9" />Munkani Ibilisi, bu'kapo muyi'me kwo kangamala muimani yinu, kamutanga panga alongo binu padunia yoti bapi'tya mateso nyinyonyo kati gamubile nago. <verse eid="1PE 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10" />Bu'ka po teselwa kwa masu'ba masene, Nnu'ngu' ywa ngu'ngu' yoti ywankema panga kiselele muutukupu wake wangali yomoka kwo lu'mbana na Kilisitu, ywembe mwene aalu'a kunkangamaya na kunkong'ondelya, kumpeya makakala na nsingi nkangamau. <verse eid="1PE 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11" />Ywembe nga Nnu'ngu' mwene uweso kwa milele na milele. Amina.<verse eid="1PE 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Salamu ya kuundi'la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12" />Kwa luboko lwa Silwano, nnongo ywau'bi'li'ka kati mwanitangite, nimwandikya kwa mayi'gi'yo maipi, li'nga kunsenga na kunkong'ondelya panga ayi' nga ngu'ngu' ya kweli ya Nnu'ngu'. Muyi'me kwo kangamala kwa yo.<verse eid="1PE 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13" />Asaulilwa ainu ba kanisa lya pano pa Babeli, bendakunsalimia. Kai', na Maluko, ywembe mwana wangu' muimani, endakunsalimia. <verse eid="1PE 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14" />Musalimiyane kwa upendo wa kweli.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 5:14">Ninnu'byanga mwaboti mwamubile mu Kilisitu amani ibe kwinu.<verse eid="1PE 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5" />
</usx>